eware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/tabs/DefaultTabRepositoryTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabgroups/TabGroupsStripTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabgroups/strip/SelectedTabNavigationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabgroups/strip/TabGroupsStripContentTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabgroups/strip/redux/TabGroupsStripMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabgroups/strip/redux/TabGroupsStripTelemetryMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/redux/middleware/TabStorageMiddlewareTest.kt"], "git_node": "73fc13dc29424d1226cbca6d2acc5ad61f74b438", "git_parents": ["9bb8c7cef7902788a9a0c0aceec8b64a8ef1a201"], "node": "91b620e99120448eaf582d5858581bfcf6631569", "parents": ["2f1b78db3a802a337c5148f709aaf4b15d736479"], "tags": []}, {"author": "John M. Schanck \u003cjschanck@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089109 - fix updatebot blocking bug for NSS uplifts. r=keeler. UPGRADE_NSS_RELEASE\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340070\n", "files": ["security/nss/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "28b1be3ef8852c7e5d8dad153b942cced185de18", "git_parents": ["73fc13dc29424d1226cbca6d2acc5ad61f74b438"], "node": "8d8f60d44b983cf0e61a243d9d620d284e00e232", "parents": ["91b620e99120448eaf582d5858581bfcf6631569"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tyler Etchart \u003ctetchart@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080916 - changed browser_utils_records_cache.js to wait for condition to fix test flake r=rrando\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340075\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_utils_records_cache.js"], "git_node": "e95ce609b602b1467d7b7c69e0f19aa28f2e74f7", "git_parents": ["28b1be3ef8852c7e5d8dad153b942cced185de18"], "node": "4a7164404bf8ff923d4b9e4f8510f19fa2113ad7", "parents": ["8d8f60d44b983cf0e61a243d9d620d284e00e232"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2020282 - Remove browser.search.widget.removeAfterDaysUnused and related behavior. r=search-reviewers,urlbar-reviewers,jteow\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313997\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/customizableui/SearchWidgetTracker.sys.mjs", "browser/components/customizableui/test/browser.toml", "browser/components/customizableui/test/browser_searchbar_removal.js", "browser/components/search/content/searchbar.js", "browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarParentController.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/searchbar/browser_search.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/searchbar/head.js"], "git_node": "090d94712d684d0415dbb896352289901bc61391", "git_parents": ["e95ce609b602b1467d7b7c69e0f19aa28f2e74f7"], "node": "928b68c6bcdf8365b0053ee67a953f9fc357135b", "parents": ["4a7164404bf8ff923d4b9e4f8510f19fa2113ad7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Taimur Hasan \u003cthasan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088244 - Detect Cloudflare Turnstile's current widget frame r=tjr\n\nCloudflare now serves the Turnstile widget from an \"f/av0/rch\" frame path\ninstead of \"if/ov2/av0/rcv\", so CaptchaDetection missed every current\nTurnstile widget. The handler now matches both paths.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338970\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/captchadetection/CaptchaDetectionChild.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "aa9d985f754436b95d33c77e7d796f5d9e578e7b", "git_parents": ["090d94712d684d0415dbb896352289901bc61391"], "node": "286348fdbf12c053e8a725ee13590f79e3f56667", "parents": ["928b68c6bcdf8365b0053ee67a953f9fc357135b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Declare the js role in the intl locale environment and startup docs r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\nThese pages used the role without declaring it and only rendered because\nlocale.md, which declares it, happened to be read earlier by the same process.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335908\n", "files": ["intl/docs/locale_env.md", "intl/docs/locale_startup.md"], "git_node": "413fd42c0e91e4feb4dd931f48df7f315147500d", "git_parents": ["aa9d985f754436b95d33c77e7d796f5d9e578e7b"], "node": "82c3ac20eeea9908a6327a5db597164c4aa1bf29", "parents": ["286348fdbf12c053e8a725ee13590f79e3f56667"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084046 - Add cyclonedx and its dependencies to the docs virtualenv r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\nautodoc imports mozbuild.vendor.sbom_cyclonedx, which needs them.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335894\n", "files": ["python/sites/docs.txt"], "git_node": "b9dc7de79066839aedb8f1b4bbee5035a4fa11d4", "git_parents": ["413fd42c0e91e4feb4dd931f48df7f315147500d"], "node": "632260bf2b284e82dc5e0bc397ccaa0b4a52d94d", "parents": ["82c3ac20eeea9908a6327a5db597164c4aa1bf29"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084046 - Leave build actions that cannot be imported out of the Python API docs r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\ncheck_binary and test_archive read the build configuration at import time, and xpidl-process is not a valid module name, so autodoc can only warn about them.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335895\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "tools/moztreedocs/__init__.py"], "git_node": "bbe28ea7cfbc0742d8ef99f6db37334d1352d734", "git_parents": ["b9dc7de79066839aedb8f1b4bbee5035a4fa11d4"], "node": "36ba72b4d2916d6f322931d7453a2565dd285335", "parents": ["632260bf2b284e82dc5e0bc397ccaa0b4a52d94d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084046 - Disable autosummary stub generation in the docs r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\nsphinx-js loads autosummary, which scans every page for stubs to generate and warns because it only supports .rst sources.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335896\n", "files": ["docs/conf.py", "docs/config.yml"], "git_node": "2f8d679a401e4c101aa935ce3ba944d9e512ce17", "git_parents": ["bbe28ea7cfbc0742d8ef99f6db37334d1352d734"], "node": "e439efa8ed20ea969dc1e84f0894c4bcc1efb49a", "parents": ["36ba72b4d2916d6f322931d7453a2565dd285335"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Stop listing ProcessHandlerMixin constructor arguments as members r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\nprocessOutputLine, onTimeout and onFinish are constructor arguments, already documented in the class docstring, not attributes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335897\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "testing/mozbase/docs/mozprocess.md"], "git_node": "d9f6b354672f09d40fd6196ae71145cbd793d7c3", "git_parents": ["2f8d679a401e4c101aa935ce3ba944d9e512ce17"], "node": "8435cfe57f09fae25b0c5fa066bc42341cf81d07", "parents": ["e439efa8ed20ea969dc1e84f0894c4bcc1efb49a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Fix the server-locations.txt link in the ServerLocations.read docstring r=mozbase-reviewers,ahal\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335898\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "testing/mozbase/mozprofile/mozprofile/permissions.py"], "git_node": "d1c78497a617a7682f3da6e8319e5890142e8044", "git_parents": ["d9f6b354672f09d40fd6196ae71145cbd793d7c3"], "node": "765b4084d3c3cdfbe60810229e238837fb441e53", "parents": ["8435cfe57f09fae25b0c5fa066bc42341cf81d07"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Replace the missing target.mozinfo.json download with an inline example r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\nThe example file was never added to the tree.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335899\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "testing/docs/automated-testing/manifest-sandbox.md"], "git_node": "50c50e80cef13281308ff7eb937053e7d0a594fd", "git_parents": ["d1c78497a617a7682f3da6e8319e5890142e8044"], "node": "378c56712a8832eeda3c4e332b4e0d70f33fea28", "parents": ["765b4084d3c3cdfbe60810229e238837fb441e53"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Stop documenting Mozilla.UITour twice r=omc-reviewers,mviar\n\nThe UITour-lib page already renders the class description.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335900\n", "files": ["browser/components/uitour/docs/index.md", "docs/config.yml"], "git_node": "6835dbc3f5dfddeca90a0ca50af88aa1b99710f2", "git_parents": ["50c50e80cef13281308ff7eb937053e7d0a594fd"], "node": "48d9a5d017208fb12e8bfd9d4053fb920cf8b072", "parents": ["378c56712a8832eeda3c4e332b4e0d70f33fea28"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Separate the nested list in the EventManager JSDoc with a blank line r=extension-reviewers,robwu\n\nreStructuredText needs it to render the list.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335901\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "toolkit/components/extensions/ExtensionCommon.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "b7ef70363ef7dd6984d66e1bf1af404e0d093913", "git_parents": ["6835dbc3f5dfddeca90a0ca50af88aa1b99710f2"], "node": "fb926ec0f832b1a05f99759c50b5213d916ec38a", "parents": ["48d9a5d017208fb12e8bfd9d4053fb920cf8b072"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Separate the list in the getBuiltinAddonVersion JSDoc with a blank line r=extension-reviewers,robwu\n\nreStructuredText needs it to render the list.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335902\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/AddonManager.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "106b4550dbe7b5c7839822dda769aa72cf509a50", "git_parents": ["b7ef70363ef7dd6984d66e1bf1af404e0d093913"], "node": "b65bea7bc9cc8cae35227a3e8abae23cf2f03a14", "parents": ["fb926ec0f832b1a05f99759c50b5213d916ec38a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Fix the examples and references in the XPCOMUtils.defineLazy JSDoc r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\nEach mid-description @example swallowed the prose up to the next tag, and the @see tags inside the definition parameter rendered as a garbled See also block.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335903\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "js/xpconnect/loader/XPCOMUtils.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "3522debd7109ebfb6083b110614b6f0a7aa7d307", "git_parents": ["106b4550dbe7b5c7839822dda769aa72cf509a50"], "node": "e8142d2c310a9690aac344fdba028d867c98c3b1", "parents": ["b65bea7bc9cc8cae35227a3e8abae23cf2f03a14"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Link SavedFrame to the published Debugger.Source documentation r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\njs/src/doc/Debugger is excluded from the build; the DevTools user docs carry the published copy.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335904\n", "files": ["js/src/doc/SavedFrame/index.md"], "git_node": "aaf013f568780e81b0b5b93093c73e9d2ed5cc43", "git_parents": ["3522debd7109ebfb6083b110614b6f0a7aa7d307"], "node": "14785785fba1e464155eb19392e8191d57fe1d0d", "parents": ["e8142d2c310a9690aac344fdba028d867c98c3b1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Give the config argument a type in the beetmover artifact map docstrings r=taskgraph-reviewers,releng-reviewers,jcristau\n\nThe empty type made Sphinx resolve 'config' against every attribute of that name.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335905\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/util/scriptworker.py"], "git_node": "540e458abe6e484a3993dca49b251600b56831f7", "git_parents": ["aaf013f568780e81b0b5b93093c73e9d2ed5cc43"], "node": "5d4224a7120a680a8227911d16dab1d2d3aacc6c", "parents": ["14785785fba1e464155eb19392e8191d57fe1d0d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084047 - Fail the docs build on any warning outside NSS and the Rust component bindings r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\nThe broad allowed_warnings patterns let new warnings of a known kind through anywhere in the tree. Keep only page-scoped entries for warnings whose source is imported from upstream, and the graphviz check that depends on the local setup.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335906\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml"], "git_node": "30a46df6ee8cd020b1363766841df88a4475be53", "git_parents": ["540e458abe6e484a3993dca49b251600b56831f7"], "node": "12f668fcf0b6291d9204df4701f08eec02ee88b0", "parents": ["5d4224a7120a680a8227911d16dab1d2d3aacc6c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1996221 - Support the Navigation API in javascript: URL documents. r=vhilla\" for causing wpt failures & assertion crashes\n\nThis reverts commit 9332ac41783dd33f8aa5c213ed757ef23e6e497a.\n", "files": ["docshell/base/CanonicalBrowsingContext.cpp", "docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "docshell/shistory/SessionHistoryEntry.cpp", "docshell/shistory/SessionHistoryEntry.h", "dom/navigation/Navigation.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/navigation-api/navigation-history-entry/entries-after-javascript-url-navigation.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/navigation-api/navigation-history-entry/entries-in-new-javascript-url-iframe.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/browsers/browsing-the-web/navigating-across-documents/javascript-url-nested-history.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/browsers/browsing-the-web/navigating-across-documents/resources/page-with-iframe.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/navigation-api/navigation-activation/activation-javascript-url.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/navigation-api/navigation-history-entry/entries-after-javascript-url-navigation-forward.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/navigation-api/navigation-history-entry/entries-after-traversing-to-javascript-url-entry.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/navigation-api/navigation-history-entry/entries-in-new-javascript-url-window.html"], "git_node": "3115506424d7f280594725f2fa49f2ab50165cd6", "git_parents": ["30a46df6ee8cd020b1363766841df88a4475be53"], "node": "7de4c52e9914c87bbcbbaf9a55d9cd54fcc60a34", "parents": ["12f668fcf0b6291d9204df4701f08eec02ee88b0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "nickgrato \u003cngrato@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089668 - Fix color contrast of the Recommended badge on the clarifying question card. r=yjamora\n\nThe badge text used --color-accent-primary on a --color-violet-10 background,\nwhich only reaches about 4.2:1 contrast and fails WCAG AA. Use the tokens from\nthe Figma design instead: --smartwindow-text-color-accent-primary for the text\n(with a fallback, since it is only defined when Nova is enabled) and\n--color-violet-0 for the light background, giving about 7.1:1.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340057\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-clarifying-question/ai-clarifying-question.css"], "git_node": "37cca691cedef019fc0714c25d18c25bff69eaf5", "git_parents": ["3115506424d7f280594725f2fa49f2ab50165cd6"], "node": "3335c79f10b250c2ce843d5f14492667f2fc2101", "parents": ["7de4c52e9914c87bbcbbaf9a55d9cd54fcc60a34"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Beth Rennie \u003cbeth@brennie.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089620 - Register Nimbus pings with Glean r=android-reviewers,ohall\n\nThe nimbus-targeting-context ping has not been regsitered with Glean and\nthus we have been submitting empty enrollment status telemetry on the\nfirst ping submission from each client.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340026\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/samples/glean/src/main/java/org/mozilla/samples/glean/GleanApplication.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/GleanHelper.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/metrics/GleanMetricsService.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/telemetry/GleanMetricsService.kt"], "git_node": "e207747691c6be0fcff3e1e4695bc6c393010927", "git_parents": ["37cca691cedef019fc0714c25d18c25bff69eaf5"], "node": "1fcec4b1ff433875c0bad38e1e674c8e4b078339", "parents": ["3335c79f10b250c2ce843d5f14492667f2fc2101"], "tags": []}, {"author": "John M. Schanck \u003cjschanck@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063099 - explicitly annotate WebAuthn related origin request with mozAnon flag. r=mfarrell\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318260\n", "files": ["dom/webauthn/WebAuthnRelatedOriginFetcher.sys.mjs", "dom/webauthn/tests/test_webauthn_related_origin.html"], "git_node": "964df8d9e8b4b673e5bf47609c8b1b8f3d01db74", "git_parents": ["e207747691c6be0fcff3e1e4695bc6c393010927"], "node": "c0430fb6f890842568574ea76da7c1df707dd3ee", "parents": ["1fcec4b1ff433875c0bad38e1e674c8e4b078339"], "tags": []}, {"author": "John M. Schanck \u003cjschanck@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064175 - reject http redirects immediately in WebAuthn related-origin fetch. r=mfarrell\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319218\n", "files": ["dom/webauthn/WebAuthnRelatedOriginFetcher.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "7df6d05df090eed0915882eb45ed57f97cead3df", "git_parents": ["964df8d9e8b4b673e5bf47609c8b1b8f3d01db74"], "node": "cfb667d1ea4ebd4d5ffbdc537ec651e5e819062a", "parents": ["c0430fb6f890842568574ea76da7c1df707dd3ee"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089066 - Fix failing verifyLongTapShortcutDisplaysEditShortcutTest efficiency UI test r=aaronmt\n\nThe UI test was failing because on the Customize screen, the test's tap on the \"Share\" option was landing while the settings list was still gliding from its scroll, so the tap got swallowed and Share was never actually selected, even though the test thought the click succeeded.\n\nTo fix this, instead of tapping the screen where the \"Share\" row appeared (the old ViewActions.click(), which could miss while the list was still gliding to a stop), we now use performClick() to tell the row to activate itself directly \u2014 so it gets selected reliably, even mid-scroll.\n\nThe UI test successfully passed 50x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339923\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/core/UiActions.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/BasePage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/SettingsCustomizeSimpleToolbarTest.kt"], "git_node": "80596e67b24919db05aba8f9c19cd2fac6cc24d2", "git_parents": ["7df6d05df090eed0915882eb45ed57f97cead3df"], "node": "3aaecae48800f3033130bd4c7450b7ac027ff6e1", "parents": ["cfb667d1ea4ebd4d5ffbdc537ec651e5e819062a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "scottdowne \u003csdowne@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084043 - Change newtab spaces preview file types to webp r=jaws,jbrown\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340041\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/data/content/assets/spaces-preview-activity.png", "browser/extensions/newtab/data/content/assets/spaces-preview-kit-activity.png", "browser/extensions/newtab/data/content/assets/spaces-preview-kit-stories.png", "browser/extensions/newtab/data/content/assets/spaces-preview-kit-widgets.png", "browser/extensions/newtab/data/content/assets/spaces-preview-stories.png", "browser/extensions/newtab/data/content/assets/spaces-preview-widgets.png"], "git_node": "929e7466e877cf44a15ae5cfe388abe710b8aca2", "git_parents": ["80596e67b24919db05aba8f9c19cd2fac6cc24d2"], "node": "996b3cd59656345e5e5d071f6628578432a8a15d", "parents": ["3aaecae48800f3033130bd4c7450b7ac027ff6e1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ansh \u003cansinha@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084958 - Update the \"account card\" on the global Settings screen when there is no authenticated account r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,tthibaud\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337344\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/SettingsFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/account/AccountUiView.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/account/SignInPromoPreference.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/drawable/kit_sign_in_promo.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/preference_keys.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/xml/preferences.xml"], "git_node": "dad5f0c681918eb9ca90dd155c1cdcdbdb4bfeb6", "git_parents": ["929e7466e877cf44a15ae5cfe388abe710b8aca2"], "node": "1c1c006207704d49e63e716d5cddfeda16fcb86c", "parents": ["996b3cd59656345e5e5d071f6628578432a8a15d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dana Keeler \u003cdkeeler@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089471 - return early from CacheRemoteCryptokiObjects if remote pkcs#11 is disabled r=jschanck\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340078\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsNSSIOLayer.cpp"], "git_node": "f084f541f4597835d790d094f3a581eaf39bfbcd", "git_parents": ["dad5f0c681918eb9ca90dd155c1cdcdbdb4bfeb6"], "node": "23dbbcf6786affbe4f2da33b6023ab1a0f8cd345", "parents": ["1c1c006207704d49e63e716d5cddfeda16fcb86c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079533 - Update Sentry to version 8.63.0. r=android-reviewers,tcampbell\n\nSentryFeatureGatesTest now checks the resolved data collection policy instead of the newly deprecated\nisSendDefaultPii. With no DataCollection configured, the resolver falls back to sendDefaultPii, so the\ncollected data does not change.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340087\n", "files": ["gradle/libs.versions.toml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/lib/crash-sentry/src/test/java/mozilla/components/lib/crash/sentry/SentryFeatureGatesTest.kt"], "git_node": "ede6c8db0462b8f6c92961eb4e331cbe9ba2ed50", "git_parents": ["f084f541f4597835d790d094f3a581eaf39bfbcd"], "node": "10103f059f00cd73656ced5ffe0896e7c7948dd8", "parents": ["23dbbcf6786affbe4f2da33b6023ab1a0f8cd345"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080756 - doc: move the uplift doc in tree r=firefox-source-docs-reviewers,ahal\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335882\n", "files": ["docs/config.yml", "docs/release-mgmt/index.md", "docs/release-mgmt/requesting_an_uplift.md", "docs/release-mgmt/up