er/getter. r=emilio,saschanaz\n\nAfter https://github.com/WICG/webcomponents/issues/1093, in bug 1989323,\nreferenceTarget IDL attribute for ShadowRoot / ShadowRootInit and\nshadowRootReferenceTarget for HTMLTemplateElement were made nullable.\nHowever, nullability was not taken into account in the C++\nimplementations. This CL makes sure a null value is returned when the\ncontent attribute is absent and that setting to a null value removes\nthe content attribute.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340343\n", "files": ["dom/html/HTMLTemplateElement.h", "testing/web-platform/meta/shadow-dom/reference-target/tentative/shadowrootreferencetarget-idl-reflection.html.ini"], "git_node": "707f4262d803178e132d8556e8b95e800f882b46", "git_parents": ["5440cda849295770a6a3d1237f7b966cc4e57a8c"], "node": "4befb9706b364e2147088d90cefe83ea0f9497bf", "parents": ["3299dddeaf5dd5f5aaffb7f7cc6d373a27ce8d3d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089512 - Rename anchors-{visible,valid} to singular anchor-{visible,valid} r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,layout-reviewers,emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340018\n", "files": ["layout/base/AnchorPositioningUtils.cpp", "layout/style/nsStyleStruct.cpp", "layout/style/test/property_database.js", "servo/components/style/properties/longhands.toml", "servo/components/style/values/specified/position.rs"], "git_node": "808fce9db946930285707d02241f1d146405733f", "git_parents": ["707f4262d803178e132d8556e8b95e800f882b46"], "node": "4ecae0bbbe6ea7ba9062d0036bc206a26c4192ef", "parents": ["4befb9706b364e2147088d90cefe83ea0f9497bf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089512 - Rename and update test files for anchor-visible value renaming. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D34