er an assistant message, or not at all during a chat.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332935\n", "files": ["browser/components/DesktopActorRegistry.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/metrics.yaml", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/actors/AIChatContentChild.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/actors/AIChatContentParent.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-action-result/ai-action-result.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-chat-content/ai-chat-content.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-window/ai-window.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow.toml", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_first_action_log_telemetry.js"], "git_node": "231465e64156164c3a9faf65361346e662b5c2f5", "git_parents": ["501e135add4dc6f78b0249c3e3f0bd69b1346b0c"], "node": "8e7b046cf54cce43a6dafaaa7f5ea1d7bbed3382", "parents": ["2c6e9407e078aba1a902f907c55392ec444ca048"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073260 - Cover action-log telemetry across search handoff r=jlewis\n\nThis commit verifies that a pending search action log records against the\noriginal request before navigation and remains a single event after the\nconversation continues in the sidebar.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332936\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_run_search_telemetry.js"], "git_node": "234f5efdba8852b325c4dba6ad2c4ac7c48dfa77", "git_parents": ["231465e64156164c3a9faf65361346e662b5c2f5"], "node": "7d810206a9f88cc5c3365d59198d408f55d107f7", "parents": ["8e7b046cf54cce43a6dafaaa7f5ea1d7bbed3382"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073261 - Measure completed chat turns r=jlewis,mzhang\n\nThis commit records completion duration and work counts for each\nsuccessful non-retry chat turn. The turn index and initial context size\nallow dashboards to distinguish the first turn from later turns.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333003\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/metrics.yaml", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/Chat.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-window/ai-window.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow.toml", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_first_turn_direct_answer_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_first_turn_outcomes_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_first_turn_sidebar_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_first_turn_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_first_turn_work_counts_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/head_smartwindow_first_turn_telemetry.js"], "git_node": "608183c27636bc73902f77d6d385370dfd749224", "git_parents": ["234f5efdba8852b325c4dba6ad2c4ac7c48dfa77"], "node": "41b684c693d61329ea03fed3d8030732ef96ef81", "parents": ["7d810206a9f88cc5c3365d59198d408f55d107f7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073261 - Cover turn completion telemetry across search handoff r=jlewis\n\nThis commit verifies that search handoff does not prematurely record\nturn completion and documents the missing completion event as an\nexpected failure under bug 2075708.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333004\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_run_search_telemetry.js"], "git_node": "8b269775adb167137428f42cabd6e4f9a9626c4e", "git_parents": ["608183c27636bc73902f77d6d385370dfd749224"], "node": "f49563b36e1e6d754a449cefa1980b8d6bb3601a", "parents": ["41b684c693d61329ea03fed3d8030732ef96ef81"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084819 - Split SmartWindow request/response telemetry tests r=jlewis\n\nThis commit separates the existing cases into success, build-error,\nstream-error, and retry test files with shared setup. Test bodies and\nassertions are unchanged.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336082\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow.toml", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_request_response_build_errors_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_request_response_retry_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_request_response_stream_errors_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_request_response_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/head_smartwindow_request_response_telemetry.js"], "git_node": "a16df6fbb8ec9223326c818594ca595163dc9041", "git_parents": ["8b269775adb167137428f42cabd6e4f9a9626c4e"], "node": "de3105c86003b9d0d6c49f5bcf8f4fee68d92daf", "parents": ["f49563b36e1e6d754a449cefa1980b8d6bb3601a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084819 - Finish HTTP chat work in request/response telemetry tests r=jlewis\n\nThis commit gives successful request/response telemetry tests an owned\nHTTP chat fixture and waits for response and title work before advancing\nto another conversation or closing the window.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336083\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_request_response_telemetry.js"], "git_node": "91ebfd0200f49841c7eabdd1991ab35892dd1356", "git_parents": ["a16df6fbb8ec9223326c818594ca595163dc9041"], "node": "3d013fd2c14ef93324b9497475b6fe091200d04b", "parents": ["de3105c86003b9d0d6c49f5bcf8f4fee68d92daf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084819 - Control search-handoff responses and cleanup r=jlewis,omarg\n\nThis commit uses engine and search mocks to complete search handoffs\nthrough the real chat and sidebar paths.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336084\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/AIWindowTestUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_run_search.js"], "git_node": "300a5bfddcf6d3b45646f9f0896babe77e364385", "git_parents": ["91ebfd0200f49841c7eabdd1991ab35892dd1356"], "node": "1a20fd60b5bc0bfcc7ece4f2e110d8604bce75bb", "parents": ["3d013fd2c14ef93324b9497475b6fe091200d04b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084819 - Stabilize SmartWindow prompts test readiness and runtime r=jlewis\n\nThis commit waits for the chat content shadow root before observing its\nfooter and allows the prompts test file more time to finish.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336085\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_prompts.js"], "git_node": "bd6147c3e750b768beee71690cefa5c6414f0a98", "git_parents": ["300a5bfddcf6d3b45646f9f0896babe77e364385"], "node": "ca75fe9fea9131440f1a6f31f61a366c91dc2648", "parents": ["1a20fd60b5bc0bfcc7ece4f2e110d8604bce75bb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084819 - Disable semantic history in SmartWindow prompts tests r=jlewis\n\nThis commit disables semantic-history background work in the prompts test\nfile to avoid embedding-model initialization during prompt UI tests.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336086\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_prompts.js"], "git_node": "d909f502a2323f1616ea009a4da1d885aaf6a532", "git_parents": ["bd6147c3e750b768beee71690cefa5c6414f0a98"], "node": "7347b7540e6530b5a3cbde2846f7e3e149ae4685", "parents": ["ca75fe9fea9131440f1a6f31f61a366c91dc2648"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084819 - Prefer reduced motion in SmartWindow chaos tests r=jlewis\n\nThis commit requests reduced motion for SmartWindow tests running under\nMOZ_CHAOSMODE. Other test runs retain their existing animation settings.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336087\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/head.js"], "git_node": "83224a7d2fb3837d90a749cb302654506db72f38", "git_parents": ["d909f502a2323f1616ea009a4da1d885aaf6a532"], "node": "c130284233df9a657cc46cee3415f68276be209a", "parents": ["7347b7540e6530b5a3cbde2846f7e3e149ae4685"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084819 - Fix overlapping starter prompt cancellation r=jlewis\n\nThis commit preserves cancellation of the latest starter load when an\nolder load finishes, preventing prompts from reappearing after chat\nsubmission. A regression test exercises the overlapping loads before\nconversation messages arrive.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336088\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-window/ai-window.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_prompts.js"], "git_node": "8cea3fea73250957e652967273b1e4f8ed8841d6", "git_parents": ["83224a7d2fb3837d90a749cb302654506db72f38"], "node": "5d63f073eee9a6c084d21047f59b330daa16618b", "parents": ["c130284233df9a657cc46cee3415f68276be209a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2028654 - Re-enable SmartWindow telemetry tests on Windows debug standalone r=jlewis\n\nThis commit restores SmartWindow telemetry test coverage on\nWindows debug standalone builds by removing the skips associated\nwith Bug 2028654.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336089\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow.toml", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/head_smartwindow_request_response_telemetry.js"], "git_node": "2e0e9761433d40858fa69eb32974072e61eb5d09", "git_parents": ["8cea3fea73250957e652967273b1e4f8ed8841d6"], "node": "bd80bcdd071c1129f8e14e92ca4fef8cb732a09b", "parents": ["5d63f073eee9a6c084d21047f59b330daa16618b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088327 - Check out the full tree in doc-generate and doc-upload r=linter-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nOn hg, the `sphinx-docs` sparse profile gives `doc-generate` and\n`doc-upload` a checkout cache separate from the other tasks on their\nworker pools. On try that cache was cold the vast majority of the time,\nso they cloned the whole repository. A full checkout shares the cache\nof the other tasks on the pool, which should raise the hit rate of\n`doc-upload` to about 70%. The remaining misses get slightly slower\nbecause a full checkout writes more files, but the hits more than make\nup for it in aggregate.\n\nWhen these tasks switch from hg to Git, nothing changes for them. Git\ntasks already ignore the `sphinx-docs` sparse profile, because its\n`# git-checkout: full` marker asks for a full checkout, which is\nfaster than a sparse one on Git.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340226\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/source-test/doc.yml"], "git_node": "93ae409718911fd08323316f07b8457880e378a8", "git_parents": ["2e0e9761433d40858fa69eb32974072e61eb5d09"], "node": "95bfbec0d9a903d75946aa91e52b9a29632bc24b", "parents": ["bd80bcdd071c1129f8e14e92ca4fef8cb732a09b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sam Foster \u003csfoster@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1935831 - Fix touch event handling for the overlay buttons. r=niklas\n\n- The overlay actively prevents touch events so they don't reach the page. This means a tap never produces a click and doesnt fire the buttons handlers.\n- Button event listeners like pointerup may close the overlay - allowing later events like touchend through to the page underneath\n- So, instead, handle button taps on touchend - which is the last event fired by a tap.\n- We need to round when comparing coordindates with syntheized touch events - so I'm using isfuzzy\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340514\n", "files": ["browser/actors/ScreenshotsComponentChild.sys.mjs", "browser/components/screenshots/ScreenshotsOverlayChild.sys.mjs", "browser/components/screenshots/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/screenshots/tests/browser/browser_test_touch.js", "browser/components/screenshots/tests/browser/head.js"], "git_node": "133e2d7e93d3e402a5f15d2f8aa576e60f79e154", "git_parents": ["93ae409718911fd08323316f07b8457880e378a8"], "node": "b0a9d8ce7bcc2863350fb31921e7a5fb968935cf", "parents": ["95bfbec0d9a903d75946aa91e52b9a29632bc24b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "scottdowne \u003csdowne@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061408 - Ensure newtab placeholder animation doesn't run until document is visible r=mconley,ini\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316886\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/activity-stream.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamComponents/DSCard/_DSCard.scss"], "git_node": "d8cb3ed71e1facac6eab3e36e617f08575ac3bf0", "git_parents": ["133e2d7e93d3e402a5f15d2f8aa576e60f79e154"], "node": "d988686fe2df3d84b25025ca087ee7d70c3263ce", "parents": ["b0a9d8ce7bcc2863350fb31921e7a5fb968935cf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gela \u003cgmalekpour@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2090313 - Move credit card number validation from Fenix to support-utils. r=android-reviewers,harrisono\n\nThis lets the save credit card prompt in feature-prompts use the same check as the Fenix credit card editor. Fenix's\ncopies of `toCreditCardNumber()` and `last4Digits()` are removed too, since support-utils and support-ktx have the same\nfunctions.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340533\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/support/utils/src/main/java/mozilla/components/support/utils/CreditCardUtils.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/support/utils/src/test/java/mozilla/components/support/utils/CreditCardUtilsTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/docs/changelog.md", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/creditcards/String.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/creditcards/ui/CreditCardEditorReducer.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/creditcards/StringTest.kt"], "git_node": "80370bf30089db25d73021bb20f05b52a895338d", "git_parents": ["d8cb3ed71e1facac6eab3e36e617f08575ac3bf0"], "node": "b365a135c6ceed73188bbaf30dbc758b0b3449f2", "parents": ["d988686fe2df3d84b25025ca087ee7d70c3263ce"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/values-in/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ab/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-am/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-an/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ar/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ast/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/val