bf9200e444ea4560e314ea"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dre Grant \u003cdgrant@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074923 - Clocks: Add the nickname characters left string r=fluent-reviewers,bolsson\n\nAdds a new nickname field message that tells people how many characters they have left. The next patch uses it and removes the old message.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340080\n", "files": ["browser/locales/en-US/browser/newtab/newtab.ftl"], "git_node": "625e5f383cc6aad1f20cd3168b7750e1cbb3cd77", "git_parents": ["8e56a38957999dfa9ec241f93d7de501ccc34b61"], "node": "b7a28be8229964398c965ef2645475a0864d6b2d", "parents": ["e3103e66a86099bffc2b4cd57d22fca57f6d35d3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dre Grant \u003cdgrant@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074923 - Clocks: Show how many nickname characters are left r=fluent-reviewers,fchasen,bolsson\n\nClock nicknames are cut off at 11 characters without warning, so \u201cThe big apple\u201d saves as \u201cThe big app.\u201d The field now shows how many characters are left and counts down as someone types.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340081\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/Clocks/AddClockForm.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/AddClockForm.test.jsx", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/newtab/newtab.ftl"], "git_node": "24c1548a860d4ab82667d9a93c7de2ec0200c126", "git_parents": ["625e5f383cc6aad1f20cd3168b7750e1cbb3cd77"], "node": "67af71a95b0d1e784d00fcbc84223ce492826d7b", "parents": ["b7a28be8229964398c965ef2645475a0864d6b2d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2090778 - Move ChromeObserver initialization to SetMayStartLayout(). r=smaug\n\nMove it closer to where the attributes used to be initialized.\n\nThis prevents switching back and forth (chrome code sets some of the\nrelevant attributes on the MozBeforeInitialXULLayout event, which is\nafter switching the ready state to interactive, but before\nAppWindow::BeforeStartLayout().\n\nWe should arguably, probably, move the event closer to\nAppWindow::BeforeStartLayout, but that's a riskier change.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340883\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp"], "git_node": "0d537e71a636065be0e67262554fe95b2556a84e", "git_parents": ["24c1548a860d4ab82667d9a93c7de2ec0200c126"], "node": "56d27effa469d04c3368e7772abf39a565a23bdc", "parents": ["67af71a95b0d1e784d00fcbc84223ce492826d7b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Naz\u0131m Can Alt\u0131nova \u003ccanaltinova@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087985 - Set the beacon initiator type on sendBeacon() channels. r=bas\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338660\n", "files": ["dom/base/Navigator.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/resource-timing/initiator-type/misc.html.ini"], "git_node": "b5b1d74e8de2c4b42c915c0c6c27466b7060593b", "git_parents": ["0d537e71a636065be0e67262554fe95b2556a84e"], "node": "214bd54abe91834d1bf3471c199776234a93d628", "parents": ["56d27effa469d04c3368e7772abf39a565a23bdc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Naz\u0131m Can Alt\u0131nova \u003ccanaltinova@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088013 - Report the \"body\" initiator type for `\u003cbody background\u003e` image loads r=emilio,firefox-style-system-reviewers\n\nThe spec explicitly mentions that the `\u003cbody background\u003e` image loads\nneed to have \"body\" initiator type. We had to pass this information\nthrough servo.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338700\n", "files": ["layout/style/ImageLoader.cpp", "layout/style/MappedDeclarationsBuilder.cpp", "layout/style/ServoStyleConstsInlines.h", "servo/components/style/stylesheets/rule_parser.rs", "servo/components/style/url/gecko.rs", "servo/components/style/url/mod.rs", "servo/components/style/url/servo.rs", "servo/ports/geckolib/cbindgen.toml", "servo/ports/geckolib/glue.rs", "testing/web-platform/meta/resource-timing/initiator-type/misc.html.ini"], "git_node": "b8a4b244451ee52fc1352ddabf93239279660f6d", "git_parents": ["b5b1d74e8de2c4b42c915c0c6c27466b7060593b"], "node": "e9fe5a8e2b7da6abe8d73b68346d37da46d1639c", "parents": ["214bd54abe91834d1bf3471c199776234a93d628"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088702 - Part 3: Add MerinoMatchesStorage to persist the latest matches r=android-reviewers,android-build-system-reviewers,npoon\n\n- Add a MerinoMatchesStorage interface for the latest matches\n- Store the latest matches as JSON in a DataStore and expose them as a Flow\n- Read a corrupt or empty stored file as no matches\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339583\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/service/merino-sports/build.gradle", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/merino-sports/src/main/java/mozilla/components/service/merino/sports/MerinoMatchesStorage.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/merino-sports/src/main/java/mozilla/components/service/merino/sports/MerinoSportsJson.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/merino-sports/src/main/java/mozilla/components/service/merino/sports/MerinoSportsProvider.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/merino-sports/src/test/java/mozilla/components/service/merino/sports/DataStoreMerinoMatchesStorageTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/merino-sports/src/test/java/mozilla/components/service/merino/sports/MerinoMatchesSerializerTest.kt"], "git_node": "aa5eef32dfb4a3e314f4e98c28be52fdd759f8b1", "git_parents": ["b8a4b244451ee52fc1352ddabf93239279660f6d"], "node": "91cb11e9338c12b10d4fc583543e26d869ec9a48", "parents": ["e9fe5a8e2b7da6abe8d73b68346d37da46d