cognition_perf.js is disabled outside perftest but tagged\nparakeet-asr, so every browser-chrome chunk that contains its manifest starts\nthe model server for nothing.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340338\n", "files": ["testing/mochitest/runtests.py"], "git_node": "82ac8b0198090a827b8091a11ece86aabb3db0de", "git_parents": ["f20ea31dcca691b3eaea677dce92c0a4e7c9f0b5"], "node": "eda904feb4cf0a0ac34319fe73b451893845554e", "parents": ["5b4674156fbe4a4bb1b94c9e6e0ee66b1c8a0eb0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan Curran \u003crcurran@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2090053 - Part 2: Skip the reverse DNS lookup when starting the parakeet model server. r=media-playback-reviewers,padenot\n\nHTTPServer.server_bind() calls socket.getfqdn() on the bind address. On the\nmacOS tart VMs that lookup takes ~36s to time out, and the browser-chrome\nharness then never gets focus. With server_bind() overridden, the server\nanswers in 0.1-0.2s there and the chunks run normally.\n\nDepends on D340338\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340339\n", "files": ["testing/tools/serve_model.py"], "git_node": "4babf098ba6a3118a5bf76202e2b6f68507c6faf", "git_parents": ["82ac8b0198090a827b8091a11ece86aabb3db0de"], "node": "8a0f2f26b400f7176a50816a0cfeba4844fefb79", "parents": ["eda904feb4cf0a0ac34319fe73b451893845554e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Heitor Neiva \u003chneiva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091006 - Use larger workers for macOS compilation tasks. r=releng-reviewers,bhearsum\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340998\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/build/macosx.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/instrumented-build/kind.yml"], "git_node": "482b5f7a7c53e83498bdf5d1f267f0fc417741e5", "git_parents": ["4babf098ba6a3118a5bf76202e2b6f68507c6faf"], "node": "ec39a12c2efd1a1e26b11265dd410b50d85964df", "parents": ["8a0f2f26b400f7176a50816a0cfeba4844fefb79"], "tags": 