 from settings when it has a connection error. r=android-reviewers,gmalekpour\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341060\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/IPProtectionScreen.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/IPProtectionScreenTest.kt"], "git_node": "e28d906346e862a83614279abf09d09ddbe1a2d2", "git_parents": ["0e9fa5e82fc58c245e671913f73ce1f58c19a791"], "node": "d029c2eb156316c200c4865b9f10eaf28790e724", "parents": ["014ff786cba7e613d7d00f32f901d83f0a7511b5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Iain Ireland \u003ciireland@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1844400: Rename enable-ic-frame-pointers to enable-stub-frame-pointers r=perftest-reviewers,sparky,spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nThis also explicitly disables the flag on 32-bit x86. It already didn't work, because baseline ICs don't have enough registers, but this lets us write testcases that don't assert.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336910\n", "files": ["docs/performance/jit_profiling_with_samply.md", "js/src/jit/BaselineCacheIRCompiler.cpp", "js/src/jit/BaselineCacheIRCompiler.h", "js/src/jit/JitOptions.cpp", "js/src/jit/JitOptions.h", "js/src/shell/js.cpp", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/test/raptor.py", "testing/raptor/raptor/perf_profile.py", "testing/raptor/raptor/samply_profile.py"], "git_node": "edbd03814232f2642e39b14a2cc5786eaa6b65e9", "git_parents": ["e28d906346e862a83614279abf09d09ddbe1a2d2"], "node": "aec9b000387e0edee5e50b158d2583ec177a4405", "parents": ["d029c2eb156316c200c4865b9f10eaf28790e724"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Iain Ireland \u003ciireland@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1844400: Support frame pointers in generic call trampoline r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nThis makes the generic call trampoline about 5-10% slower in a microbenchmark, so we don't want to do it by default.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336911\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/ion/call-generic-stub-frame-pointers.js", "js/src/jit/CodeGenerator.cpp", "js/src/jit/MacroAssembler-inl.h", "js/src/jit/MacroAssembler.h"], "git_node": "952b6cf248d6aefadcfaece1dbb02d79c1c3d6ad", "git_parents": ["edbd03814232f2642e39b14a2cc5786eaa6b65e9"], "node": "b92ca5116f706831dfda49f8150c582bdcdb90ea", "parents": ["aec9b000387e0edee5e50b158d2583ec177a4405"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Iain Ireland \u003ciireland@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084754: Support stub frames in the megamorphic load stub r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337317\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/CodeGenerator.cpp"], "git_node": "249c9a3e37829dd18ff75ba8e6a016c397f7e27f", "git_parents": ["952b6cf248d6aefadcfaece1dbb02d79c1c3d6ad"], "node": "6ede0692db473abaee115c644da989bd67fbd04c", "parents": ["b92ca5116f706831dfda49f8150c582bdcdb90ea"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-nl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/base/src/main/res/values-co/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-co/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-nl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/values-co/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/values-nl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-co/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/protection-dashboard/src/main/res/values-oc/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-co/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-cy/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-dsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-es-rAR/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hy-rAM/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ia/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ja/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-nb-rNO/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-nl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-oc/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-pa-rIN/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-pt-rBR/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-tr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-zh-rTW/strings.xml", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/res/values-ca/strings.xml"], "git_node": "2165f39335249c40c97a2aeec6ecf201e5b6c5ae", "git_parents": ["249c9a3e37829dd18ff75ba8e6a016c397f7e27f"], "node": "cf45062c61e2cfe76f58a6d00060224b78a368fb", "parents": ["6ede0692db473abaee115c644da989bd67fbd04c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2090042 - Move the desktop-theme skills' token, contrast and pixel-diff scripts into toolkit/themes/tools. r=desktop-theme-reviewers,tgiles\" for causing failures at system-color-pairs.md.\n\nThis reverts commit d06b063e93e5d967a3d9d9192627c25a4cece2b7.\n", "files": [".agents/skills/desktop-theme-colors/scripts/contrast.py", ".agents/skills/desktop-theme-colors/scripts/pair-walk.py", ".agents/skills/desktop-theme-probing/scripts/firefox-probe.py", ".agents/skills/desktop-theme-probing/scripts/marker-probe.py", ".agents/skills/desktop-theme-probing/scripts/probelib.py", ".agents/skills/desktop-theme-probing/scripts/screen-grab.py", ".agents/skills/desktop-theme-screenshots/scripts/pixel-diff.py", ".agents/skills/desktop-theme-tokens/scripts/token-resolve.py", ".claude/skills/desktop-theme-colors/scripts/contrast.py", ".claude/skills/desktop-theme-colors/scripts/pair-walk.py", ".claude/skills/desktop-theme-probing/scripts/firefox-probe.py", ".claude/skills/desktop-theme-probing/scripts/marker-probe.py", ".claude/skills/desktop-theme-probing/scripts/probelib.py", ".claude/skills/desktop-theme-probing/scripts/screen-grab.py", ".claude/skills/desktop-theme-screenshots/scripts/pixel-diff.py", ".claude/skills/desktop-theme-tokens/scripts/token-resolve.py", "toolkit/themes/tools/contrast.py", "toolkit/themes/tools/pair_walk.py", "toolkit/themes/tools/pixel_diff.py", "toolkit/themes/tools/probelib.py", "toolkit/themes/tools/screen-grab.py", "toolkit/themes/tools/token_resolve.py"], "git_node": "e69e981e826a04671c6319d542facbce322624df", "git_parents": ["2165f39335249c40c97a2aeec6ecf201e5b6c5ae"], "node": "818e9d60469dc7802325f587b54e29c66460acfa", "parents": ["cf45062c61e2cfe76f58a6d00060224b78a368fb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sam Johnson \u003csam@scj.me\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087261 - Apply paragraph styles to attributed strings in native menus. r=mac-reviewers,bradwerth\n\nWhen a `NSMenuItem` has an `attributedTitle`, it defaults to an unstyled appearance, which results in some undesired effects such as clipping and incorrectly aligned RTL titles. Apply our own paragraph styles to restore the expected formatting.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341217\n", "files": ["widget/cocoa/nsMenuUtilsX.mm"], "git_node": "b9d674947a89e8e544fd49d74f128d51fb8f9a4a", "git_parents": ["e69e981e826a04671c6319d542facbce322624df"], "node": "9850ddbb027296fac581188fcabcd379ed058de4", "parents": ["818e9d60469dc7802325f587b54e29c66460acfa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091253: Enable Gecko accessibility directly when querying the application role. r=accessibility-platform-reviewers,eeejay\n\nRole queries should enable Gecko accessibility without requesting AppKit's `AXEnhancedUserInterface` mode, which can animate window moves and resizes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341235\n", "files": ["accessible/mac/Platform.mm", "accessible/moz.build", "accessible/tests/gtest/TestMacAccessibilityActivation.mm", "accessible/tests/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "15f0da0137bc07e61855eda1d594eefc8ff2310d", "git_parents": ["b9d674947a89e8e544fd49d74f128d51fb8f9a4a"], "node": "22b1ef945281a6d669695806a88897f041ed37d4", "parents": ["9850ddbb027296fac581188fcabcd379ed058de4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dana Keeler \u003cdkeeler@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086816 - enforce some ETSI cryptography minimums for QWACs r=jschanck\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341628\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/QWACTrustDomain.cpp", "security/manager/ssl/qwac_trust_anchors/test_trust_anchors/test-ca-small-rsa.pem", "security/manager/ssl/qwac_trust_anchors/test_trust_anchors/test-ca-small-rsa.pem.certspec", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs.js", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-sha1.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-sha1.pem.certspec", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-small-rsa-key.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-small-rsa-key.pem.certspec", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-small-rsa-signature.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_qwacs/1-qwac-small-rsa-signature.pem.certspec", "security/manager/ssl/trust-anchor-build-util/src/lib.rs"], "git_node": "910c3da54ae7de5319ab86988bc633bddd393768", "git_parents": ["15f0da0137bc07e61855eda1d594eefc8ff2310d"], "node": "29a79c46cac546401d02b196ded1f04163c628e4", "parents": ["22b1ef945281a6d669695806a88897f041ed37d4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sotaro Ikeda \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084816 r=gfx-reviewers,bradwerth\n\nIt improves the synchronization and lifecycle management of `TextureClient` and its associated `TextureChild` actor.\n\nThe changes clarify actor initialization, locking, and cleanup while keeping the existing texture operations largely unchanged.\n\nThe main changes include:\n\n- Protecting access to the `TextureClient` reference associated with `TextureChild`.\n- Using reference counting to safely acquire a `TextureClient` from its actor.\n- Keeping actor locking and unlocking consistent across operations.\n- Clarifying actor initialization and assignment to `TextureClient`.\n- Improving actor detachment and cleanup during shutdown.\n- Making synchronization and lifecycle requirements more explicit through comments.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338636\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/client/TextureClient.cpp", "gfx/layers/client/TextureClient.h"], "git_node": "0366b3aa2e7b1b1627060f21e1cdb88005fda1ab", "git_parents": ["910c3da54ae7de5319ab86988bc633bddd393768"], "node": "6f57028fc237f1e8ea41260d05889c6ca2d939a9", "parents": ["29a79c46cac546401d02b196ded1f04163c628e4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ansh \u003cansinha@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084958 - Update the \"account card\" on the global Settings screen when there is no authenticated account r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,tthibaud,mobiletest-reviewers,aaronmt\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337344\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/SettingsTurnOnSyncPage.kt