id-reviewers,petru\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340005\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/SecretSettingsFragment.kt"], "git_node": "4ca6eef79f223111da2dc4eb71c3bfb252a6d59d", "git_parents": ["cc4a1fd1fbeeb02785acdb5373bcd65b1fcd6e13"], "node": "35f2bd36cfedc6d391297f460929566eab2faa7d", "parents": ["5d78a971db1110854bc27da0bf917bed29fe9ff4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087496 - Resolve ClipboardContextMenu's pending request when chrome window is unloaded; r=Gijs\n\npopuphidding and popuphidden might not be fired when chrome window close\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338312\n", "files": ["dom/events/test/clipboard/browser.toml", "dom/events/test/clipboard/browser_document_command_paste_contextmenu_window_close.js", "dom/events/test/clipboard/browser_navigator_clipboard_contextmenu_window_close.js", "dom/events/test/clipboard/head.js", "testing/web-platform/meta/clipboard-apis/permissions-policy/clipboard-read/__dir__.ini", "toolkit/modules/ClipboardContextMenu.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "554cfc85ab4d6d54bf440f362d5810f39b9458c7", "git_parents": ["4ca6eef79f223111da2dc4eb71c3bfb252a6d59d"], "node": "e433bfe583fdde0d9f4401c461c66ae29eca10b1", "parents": ["35f2bd36cfedc6d391297f460929566eab2faa7d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sotaro Ikeda \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091664 - Fix fence FD ownership transfer in AndroidImageReader::AcquirePendingImage() r=gfx-reviewers,jnicol\n\nReplace fence.get() with fence.release() when calling AImage_deleteAsync() after AImage_getHardwareBuffer() fails. This transfers ownership of the fence FD to Android and prevents UniqueFileHandle from closing it again when the function returns.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341725\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/AndroidImageReader.cpp"], "git_node": "bb349535fc5b9d9045fdf033f21d6eba4aa2d3f1", "git_parents": ["554cfc85ab4d6d54bf440f362d5810f39b9458c7"], "node": "d526d4bb435ecc6a73263c2a8ab4d01b45a791a6", "parents": ["e433bfe583fdde0d9f4401c461c66ae29eca10b1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087413 - Cancel ConcurrentConnection's dispatched statements when shutdown starts. r=jteow,places-reviewers\n\nInterrupting the connection only stops the running statement. AsyncClose runs\nthe queued statements first, and if the database is locked by another process\nthey keep retrying on SQLITE_BUSY, blocking shutdown.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340472\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/places/ConcurrentConnection.cpp", "toolkit/components/places/ConcurrentConnection.h", "toolkit/components/places/tests/gtest/test_ConcurrentConnection.cpp"], "git_node": "6d58aef0e41528f68aeb12d75113ac1bd3931a73", "git_parents": ["bb349535fc5b9d9045fdf033f21d6eba4aa2d3f1"], "node": "19ebcd40a992b534dee37a337772c44bd6624019", "parents": ["d526d4bb435ecc6a73263c2a8ab4d01b45a791a6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lars Eggert \u003clars@eggert.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088370 - Forward a worker EventSource's runnables to the main thread after shutdown. r=necko-reviewers,jesup,smaug\n\nCancel the channel before shutting down so late channel events still run and OnStopRequest is delivered.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339175\n", "files": ["dom/base/EventSource.cpp", "netwerk/test/browser/browser.toml", "netwerk/test/browser/browser_eventsource_worker_close.js", "netwerk/test/browser/eventsource_worker_close.sjs", "netwerk/test/browser/eventsource_worker_close_worker.js"], "git_node": "62f8b62ffab074579b948052793f0adbcd26229a", "git_parents": ["6d58aef0e41528f68aeb12d75113ac1bd3931a73"], "node": "c9ad58536b409dcafaa1ebfb120da36d4b2f43c7", "parents": ["19ebcd40