"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chikezoe.birchill@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091273 - Stop ScrollbarsForWheel::TemporarilyActivateAllPossibleScrollTargets if the target frame is gone. r=masayuki\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341240\n", "files": ["dom/events/WheelHandlingHelper.cpp"], "git_node": "b239e60f67b3fca98eecd86a2ed824642331a633", "git_parents": ["8e40544a58c88b1d0b50c63e1902b7da9d5dce3a"], "node": "3c852fc2030f675b946412180d894a2a3e61d834", "parents": ["42bff92003cd1dc97ca491ead6822071f277d810"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chikezoe.birchill@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091273 - Stop handling a wheel event in EventStateManager::PostHandleEvent if the scroll target is gone. r=masayuki\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341242\n", "files": ["dom/events/EventStateManager.cpp"], "git_node": "8607b7f277d3b3d80a85cb2678b2b86fd0f31eb0", "git_parents": ["b239e60f67b3fca98eecd86a2ed824642331a633"], "node": "755817240234e45f8f54af6fec82d11b2299119d", "parents": ["3c852fc2030f675b946412180d894a2a3e61d834"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082322 - Correct the loop in `GdkEventQueue::IndexOf` r=m_kato\n\nIt's almost always returning `0` due to the silly mistake.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341685\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/IMContextWrapper.h"], "git_node": "f4ae3f55725f7f26926bc4b5731e1aae18757041", "git_parents": ["8607b7f277d3b3d80a85cb2678b2b86fd0f31eb0"], "node": "ee650cfddd7da7a1911d507339a46527055a41f9", "parents": ["755817240234e45f8f54af6fec82d11b2299119d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Merge autoland to mozilla-central\u00a0\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1709653-Office_365_email_handling_prompt.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1898937-goodyearfiaetrc.com.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1899829-animeflv.net.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1933929-toei-anim.co.jp.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1959046-angeljackets.com.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1960294-firstenergycorp.com.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1962642-hoanghamobile.com.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1989975-idp.infocert.it.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/2032364-sirhus.dsi.cnrs.fr.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/2035485-ncvtmis.gov.in.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/2044337-www.okini.net.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/2054006-gofilee.com.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/2059742-13coins.toast.site.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/injections/js/deduplicate_registerProtocolHandler.js", "testing/webcompat/interventions/tests/test_1898937_goodyearfiaetrc_com.py", "testing/webcompat/interventions/tests/test_1899829_animeflv_net.py", "testing/webcompat/interventions/tests/test_1959046_angeljackets_com.py", "testing/webcompat/interventions/tests/test_1962642_hoanghamobile_com.py", "testing/webcompat/interventions/tests/test_1989975_idp_infocert_it.py", "testing/webcompat/interventions/tests/test_1992923_godotfest_com.py", "testing/webcompat/interventions/tests/test_2044337_okini_net.py", "testing/webcompat/interventions/tests/test_2054006_gofilee_com.py", "testing/webcompat/interventions/tests/test_2059742_13coins_toast_site.py", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/wasm/hellbox_nowasm_fallback.js", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/wasm/jbig2_nowasm_fallback.js", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/wasm/openjpeg_nowasm_fallback.js"], "git_node": "0aa10c6a675f7595961d30d2ad81c240f8ddec43", "git_parents": ["a9a644f66adb0cbb132f042bb7df24032f56346a", "f4ae3f55725f7f26926bc4b5731e1aae18757041"], "node": "38955a610462a60a0afdedb856562477e83dcdac", "parents": ["3b0e7a18530e47dba0c56e2440d8f1fc4d5847fa", "ee650cfddd7da7a1911d507339a46527055a41f9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794456890, "git_changesets": ["57c16f7530d74379ecfe25503c4ebc3008b71aab", "95ce52dca4aee08f8a84ef43e0c61d9c4ed47d09", "290339810c3e25bb53dca48c08cdf489ac68aee2", "8c22cd66e55967cacc081dc0e3cb659f895b3479", "8042d9799b8c57b8e6d911264f47dbecd5b3637a", "3423fd005aff6164673a839796b49e4c5afc59db", "03720443b7ecda9acab5dbdcd7a7629390904a0e", "65d21a4304de1171bd70d2fb0ce4617841d51315", "28a0dbade9cee68db1394ad1f090ae30c05a08bf", "d2bc634c3e39a75346a6180e3f1e9f5b917b9e07", "66edf7707e41899c1802e2da59f42a6901315b78", "075f2d8942f4b652a9c03e54484bbfa39474f6ce", "de8bb318b84563c919c779c6ac04ae802e68a8b5", "4ebc0834c09893e510aabfb20d384d9577243a68", "31e9845ac0cef26819d9cab3512f4acb0af4eda7", "ed86af308adcfb82d5cea660e7ba743eebc32c96", "2518ea8a4c6d3d0bae8338512968eeaea3e97aa0", "3f15ac625bc3dc58a83e721b4ca19481a6c4cd06", "168d5beb050a30ce1abbbb1bff95a0b91cc1934b", "38ff3282532724282d5571fe315c0c2c8a9c283c", "8e40544a58c88b1d0b50c63e1902b7da9d5dce3a", "b239e60f67b3fca98eecd86a2ed824642331a633", "8607b7f277d3b3d80a85cb2678b2b86fd0f31eb0", "f4ae3f55725f7f26926bc4b5731e1aae18757041", "0aa10c6a675f7595961d30d2ad81c240f8ddec43"], "user": "agoloman@mozilla.com"}, "45768": {"changesets": [{"author": "Chris Peterson \u003ccpeterson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091645 - Define GkSkWStream before SkPDFDocState. r=emilio\n\nC++23 makes std::unique_ptr constexpr (P2273R3), and mozilla::UniquePtr\nis an alias for it. Clang now instantiates constexpr members such as\n~unique_ptr where they are used, not at the end of the translation unit.\n\nSkPDFDocState's inline constructor initializes a UniquePtr\u003cGkSkWStream\u003e\nmember, which can invoke the member's destructor. That instantiates\ndefault_delete\u003cGkSkWStream\u003e while GkSkWStream is still incomplete.\n\nMove GkSkWStream's class definition above SkPDFDocState's class\ndefinition so the GkSkWStream type is complete there.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341714\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/PrintTargetSkPDF.cpp"], "git_node": "80d3ad15b20332391856b5c39ccd7968b550cf14", "git_parents": ["f4ae3f55725f7f26926bc4b5731e1aae18757041"], "node": "5961bb86ddb21f65d5110546e5eaf8abf70dc4c9", "parents": ["ee650cfddd7da7a1911d507339a46527055a41f9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris Peterson \u003ccpeterson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091642 - Fix missing AutoProfilerThreadSleep declaration in nsNSSIOLayer.cpp. r=necko-reviewers,valentin\n\nAndroid's non-unified build is broken because nsNSSIOLayer.cpp uses\nAutoProfilerThreadSleep but never included ProfilerThreadSleep.h.\nnsNSSIOLayer.cpp included the declaration indirectly through\nPKCS11ModuleDB.h\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341713\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsNSSIOLayer.cpp"], "git_node": "e938f6a8c5b1455e1f7846f4525a1bf959c0ac70", "git_parents": ["80d3ad15b20332391856b5c39ccd7968b550cf14"], "node": "d9c8aa2f11c2f17a568468c1c390ebaa7ffcf1ed", "parents": ["5961bb86ddb21f65d5110546e5eaf8abf70dc4c9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-fr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-tr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-vi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/values-vi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-ar/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-be/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-bg/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-bqi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-ca/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-cak/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-co/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-cs/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-cy/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-da/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-de/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-dsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-el/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-en-rCA/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-en-rGB/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-eo/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-es-rAR/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-es-rCL/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-es-rES/strings.xml", "mobile/andr