", "git_parents": ["bee610fdd515566823e9ea3a99d8cb8dffcd6036"], "node": "791fc20a151644a9cc0097f09c663dafb2e08fc5", "parents": ["3b98bef5dfced30f863cefd5381a65072d411c30"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091603 - Stop copying certifi into pip after vendoring r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,mach-reviewers,sergesanspaille,ahal\n\npip 26.3 bundles the same certifi 2026.10.23 that is vendored separately, so\nthe copy has nothing left to do. Re-vendoring without it restores the RECORD\nfile as shipped in the wheel.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341676\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/vendor/vendor_python.py", "third_party/python/pip/pip-26.3.dist-info/RECORD"], "git_node": "2d820170df6f0dea6a7d062f81bd3709e6bdde5b", "git_parents": ["01ad4cf7834151fdb5b2f66023ff9ddb1f68220b"], "node": "4ddef34b5e946c3d84d584437ac4b094b5bd5dc2", "parents": ["791fc20a151644a9cc0097f09c663dafb2e08fc5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091603 - Remove the vendored pip-tools r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,mach-reviewers,sergesanspaille,ahal\n\nNothing has called pip-compile since bug 1659593 moved `./mach vendor python`\noff it, and pip-tools 7.4.1 no longer imports against pip 26. build and\npyproject-hooks were only pulled in by pip-tools.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341678\n", "files": ["python/sites/mach.txt", "third_party/python/build/build-1.2.2.post1.dist-info/LICENSE", "third_party/python/build/build-1.2.2.post1.dist-info/METADATA", "third_party/python/build/build-1.2.2.post1.dist-info/RECORD", "third_party/python/build/build-1.2.2.post1.dist-info/WHEEL", "third_party/python/build/build-1.2.2.post1.dist-info/entry_points.txt", "third_party/python/build/build/__init__.py", "third_party/python/build/build/__main__.py", "third_party/python/