5f848844f5319fb53"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2092335. Remove stale ANGLE vendoring files left over from the old update process. r=gfx-reviewers,jnicol\n\nSince bug 2035541 ANGLE is vendored with `mach vendor gfx/angle/moz.yaml`, and\nlocal changes live in gfx/angle/patches. Nothing reads gfx/angle/MERGE_BASE or\nwrites gfx/angle/cherry_picks.txt any more, and both still describe the\npre-2035541 chromium/7778 base. auto-update-angle.sh invoked the old\nupdate-angle.py interface and is no longer referenced by moz.yaml.\n\nvendor_from_git.py stays, since dom/canvas/test/webgl-conf/import.py still uses\nit with that directory's own MERGE_BASE.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342394\n", "files": ["gfx/angle/MERGE_BASE", "gfx/angle/auto-update-angle.sh", "gfx/angle/cherry_picks.txt", "gfx/angle/vendor_from_git.py"], "git_node": "1c25536cc51150999f9b02d7ffdabb2565c9fdef", "git_parents": ["7f686c024fd1935db873d430ff3511e9a829eb84"], "node": "5b69c056e2404e75ddf943c810ae87e6d14b833f", "parents": ["b28cdf38dc1ba0c21bba33997ef9deeccc10c45a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maile Lucks \u003cmaile.lucks@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083834 - UI updates for smart window settings and gated option for auto model - r=pdahiya,fluent-reviewers,settings-reviewers,hjones,flod,cdipersio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340970\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/Utils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-window/ai-window.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/content/firstrun.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/test_ChatModelChoice.js", "browser/components/preferences/config/aiFeatures.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/preferences.js", "browser/components/preferences/tests/aiFeatures/browser_aiFeatures_smart_window_model_selection.js", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/aiF