 []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091358. Don't use an HDR video overlay swap chain for HLG video on SDR monitors. r=ahale,gfx-reviewers,sotaro\n\nSince bug 2008887, 8-bit HLG video counts as HDR content, so on SDR monitors\nit got a PQ swap chain with no tone mapping and looked washed out. HLG is\ndesigned to display acceptably as SDR, so use the SDR swap chain for it when\nthe monitor isn't HDR. PQ keeps the HDR swap chain, since it looks dull gray\non the SDR path.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341775\n", "files": ["gfx/webrender_bindings/DCLayerTree.cpp"], "git_node": "3a1cd1f64ec28986648bafd87bba700ca44bcb0a", "git_parents": ["1db95b5afc771a115e26596da0ca4d74f9598485"], "node": "879709a5dfd266e17801d117083b5b92d4bf0ddf", "parents": ["186eeb9d3f33453e8596432c0beb74f9a22cfd9f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "rperta \u003crperta@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2092257, Bug 2076526, Bug 2082524 - Remove RustAuthState references, r=beth,android-reviewers,jonalmeida\" for causing lint failures\n\nThis reverts commit 3406174cef31b94f4727abf0d149cbd84625ccd9.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2076526 - Remove shared preferences from NimbusBuilder et al. r=android-reviewers,jonalmeida,mobiletest-reviewers,aaronmt\"\n\nThis reverts commit b3f42cd1593350e73726271b87c8e70bdafb904d.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2082524 - Update application-services to 3e0029d9f090847686ebc10d9cf6c3b9c9cec9e6 r=release-managers,android-reviewers,android-build-system-reviewers,ohall,diannaS\"\n\nThis reverts commit f6667c6eeab3d62c58a81635cc00afd3a5d81d63.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2082524 - Vendor application-services to 3e0029d9f090847686ebc10d9cf6c3b9c9cec9e6 r=bdk\"\n\nThis reverts commit e129773d813c09b6e41592b79b133bd329dd004e.\n", "files": ["Cargo.lock", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/firefox-accounts/src/main/java/mozilla/components/service/fxa/FirefoxAccount.kt", "mobile/an