4dd483d4f2774175083b68b63c5d0048c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Leo Tenenbaum \u003cltenenbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2092093 - Move instead of copying IPCNotification in DWPNotificationCallbacks constructor. r=saschanaz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342194\n", "files": ["dom/push/Declarative.cpp"], "git_node": "312b0658d4fbae1b1bb57532e2205c96fbe01757", "git_parents": ["7882638c86fb41499d485bfeddb9f70406bed761"], "node": "d66b2cb03e0c82c2a370449cfa0647aff8f0de2f", "parents": ["b97ee4bcf0ff1e10cfd1daefd4d6d77b0193b1bd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Markus Stange \u003cmstange.moz@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2092508 - Tweak the profiling label matcher for microtasks. r=canova,perftest-reviewers,sparky\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342535\n", "files": ["testing/raptor/raptor/browser_function_labels.toml"], "git_node": "475df73106cb9e1f67764b5e0ec3b0a79cd76532", "git_parents": ["312b0658d4fbae1b1bb57532e2205c96fbe01757"], "node": "ee9904a7d59ed02688b467871c87e9f60bc00866", "parents": ["d66b2cb03e0c82c2a370449cfa0647aff8f0de2f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091987 - Clear the HTTP cache when browser_installssl.js removes its certificate overrides, r=extension-reviewers,rpl.\n\nThe XPIs downloaded thanks to the overrides stayed cached, so a second run in the same browser got them from the cache, without any certificate error. This also removes the verify-standalone skip-if from the bug 1995208 test-verify annotations: --verify passes now.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342130\n", "files": ["toolkit/mozapps/extensions/test/browser/browser.toml", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/test/browser/browser_installssl.js"], "git_node": "6f3e5c023e68adbade792a987a152d7d930e57c9", "git_parents": ["475df73106cb9e1f67764b5e0ec3b0a79cd76532"], "node": "683a657d21460f7835dd52b3704a1bd425d8162f", "parents": ["ee9904a7d59ed02688b467871c87e9f60bc00866"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2092234 - Stop pinning three android-components lint checks to warning severity. r=android-reviewers,mcarare\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342303\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/lint.xml"], "git_node": "e72acd40afdf6572ee4f358f8df9b5b6df85baa9", "git_parents": ["6f3e5c023e68adbade792a987a152d7d930e57c9"], "node": "3a90542071d279da0116c6df89e3a7b05dc9aa7a", "parents": ["683a657d21460f7835dd52b3704a1bd425d8162f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091869 - Avoid unused return values flagged by Kotlin 2.5 in GeckoView tests. r=android-reviewers,mcarare\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341965\n", "files": ["mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/WebExecutorTest.kt", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/WebExtensionTest.kt"], "git_node": "b0255bea113df03a1ab8e5fcb04e3038364c59a7", "git_parents": ["e72acd40afdf6572ee4f358f8df9b5b6df85baa9"], "node": "8a381f5bbb71665f75febd6eceba7f6f0987ede3", "parents": ["3a90542071d279da0116c6df89e3a7b05dc9aa7a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091869 - Add missing dependencies that Kotlin 2.5 needs for default parameter types in android-components. r=android-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden,android-reviewers,mcarare\n\nKotlin 2.5 warns when a call relies on a default parameter value whose type is missing from the classpath:\ncreateTab in the feature-listentopage tests, and the dataprotect and firefox-relay samples.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341966\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/build.gradle", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/dataprotect/build.gradle", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/build.gradle"], "git_node": "0dda077b856c21cb0a4ecf442693d5bbdfd69011", "git_parents": ["b0255bea113df03a1ab8e5fcb04e3038364c59a7"], "node": "1d835d97f41d8070c14cf288ae78e0e8a173495d", "parents": ["8a381f5bbb71665f75febd6eceba7f6f0987ede3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091869 - Avoid unused return values flagged by Kotlin 2.5 in android-components. r=android-reviewers,mcarare\n\nDiscarded results of collection transforms and nullable-Unit lambdas become forEach calls or plain Unit types,\ntest checks whose result was dropped become assertions, and Mockito checks on must-use calls become stubbing\nor interaction assertions. SearchEngineWriterTest now matches the result URLs the writer actually emits.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341967\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/GeckoEngineSessionStateTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/GeckoEngineViewTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/NestedGeckoViewTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/tabstray/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/tabstray/TabsAdapterTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/toolbar/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/toolbar/display/DisplayToolbar.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/accounts/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/accounts/FxaWebChannelFeature.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/test/java/AddonTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/app-links/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/app/links/RedirectDialogFragment.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/customtabs/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/customtabs/CustomTabsToolbarFeature.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/playback/ListenMediaSessionServiceTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/ui/ListenSheetTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/prompts/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/prompts/file/FilePicker.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/search/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/search/storage/SearchEngineWriterTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/session/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/session/SettingsUseCases.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/lib/bookmarks-file/src/test/java/mozilla/components/lib/bookmarks/file/HtmlBookmarksFileImporterTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/digitalassetlinks/src/test/java/mozilla/components/service/digitalassetlinks/local/StatementRelationCheckerTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/service/pocket/src/test/java/mozilla/components/service/pocket/mars/api/MarsSpocsEndpointRawTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/support/base/src/test/java/mozilla/components/support/base/observer/ObserverRegistryTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/support/ktx/src/main/java/mozilla/components/support/ktx/android/graphics/SampledBitmap.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/support/test/src/main/java/mozilla/components/support/test/robolectric/Permissions.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/support/test/src/test/java/mozilla/components/support/test/ThrowPropertyTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/support/utils/src/test/java/mozilla/components/support/utils/BundleTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/support/webextensions/src/main/java/mozilla/components/support/webextensions/BuiltInWebExtensionController.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/tooling/detekt/src/main/kotlin/mozilla/components/tooling/detekt/health/SuppressionCountReport.kt"], "git_node": "a3e3bc6e2a03ff38fe9a2ca1b5bae7ab8b1d8a8b", "git_parents": ["0dda077b856c21cb0a4ecf442693d5bbdfd69011"], "node": "9a4b1d7d8490db45aaa8cfdf52ffa904063a03a4", "parents": ["1d835d97f41d8070c14cf288ae78e0e8a173495d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2091869 - Avoid unused return values flagged by Kotlin 2.5 in Fenix. r=android-reviewers,mobiletest-reviewers,aaronmt,mcarare\n\nThe toolbar test helper now reverses the tab counter menu for the bottom toolbar like production does. The\nonboarding spacers are now emitted only on non-small layouts, as their ignored takeIf intended; nothing\nchanges visually, since the small-layout pager already fills the column. AddressEnvironment.createAddress and\nthe LegacyWallpaperMigration downloader now return Unit, since no caller used their results.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341968\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/ActivityLifecycleTrace.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/ActivityStateCleaner.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/AppDataCleaner.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/BasePage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/h