's commands accesskeys, and let the check cover that menu. r=urlbar-reviewers,fluent-reviewers,bolsson,daisuke\" for causing bc tests failures at acknowledgeFeedbackAndDismissal.js\n\nThis reverts commit f4b668c9e80ee441c37d32bc62c8dcf4fbcc2d08.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2073891 - Give the address bar context menu's Add search engine items accesskeys, and let the check cover that menu. r=urlbar-reviewers,fluent-reviewers,bolsson,daisuke\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6c28c68671bc54a9770bab3ecd0300015e7ff05d.\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarProviderSearchSuggestions.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/SmartbarInput.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarInputBase.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/enUS-searchFeatures.ftl", "browser/components/urlbar/private/AddonSuggestions.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/private/AmpSuggestions.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/private/MDNSuggestions.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/private/RealtimeSuggestProvider.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/private/WeatherSuggestions.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/private/YelpSuggestions.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-autofill/browser.toml", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-autofill/browser_inputField_contextmenu_dismissal.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-results/browser_acknowledgeFeedbackAndDismissal.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser_splitbutton.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/quicksuggest/browser/browser_quicksuggest_realtime_flight_status.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/quicksuggest/browser/browser_quicksuggest_sports.js", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/browser.ftl", "python/l10n/fluent_migrations/bug_2073891_urlbar_add_engine_accesskeys.py", "python/l10n/fluent_migrations/bug_2073892_urlbar_result_menu_accesskeys.py"], "git_node": "775bcb4819101a5113e1cb0b47b8f04b79645ffb", "git_parents": ["e94c9acf839d13374c05295bb356a1d4de051f2f"], "node": "8b01a522abf518d47fbaff1282146fcde8b16d30", "parents": ["97dbb2e364937eaf0ae2fcaab01e23c4bc8e6a44"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephanie Cunnane \u003cscunnane@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088217 - Simplify the Manage settings row styling in the text selection menu. r=desktop-theme-reviewers,emilio,yjamora\n\nFor background on the Highlight to Search project, here is [the current spec](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lpprhnIKYbXSNnVE-OSmVcE1Vpm9_vBBIKIOjW8_0lE/edit?tab=t.os3nbc21wjhe).\n\nTo manually experiment with this feature, here is [the UX prototype](https://searchux.netlify.app/highlight-to-search/).\n\nThe Manage settings row looks the same, but its padding and icon gap are now set once with logical properties instead of a mirrored copy for RTL and an override of a shared spacing token.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342294\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/content-area.css"], "git_node": "fa8844beebd96bdc83afaceab03028d561c196e3", "git_parents": ["775bcb4819101a5113e1cb0b47b8f04b79645ffb"], "node": "3884962d6354755dd09d8d2515c115cccdea7a72", "parents": ["8b01a522abf518d47fbaff1282146fcde8b16d30"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dustin Whisman \u003cdwhisman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1996168 - Use logical properties for spacing/positioning r=browser-installer-reviewers,extension-reviewers,webcompat-reviewers,search-reviewers,scunnane,twisniewski,spohl,desktop-theme-reviewers,akulyk,rpl\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337163\n", "files": [".stylelintrc.js", "browser/components/extensions/extension.css", "browser/components/search/test/browser/telemetry/serp.css"], "git_node": "cbf384d7d7170a19888a54e368a2a999a60cb754", "git_parents": ["fa8844beebd96bdc83afaceab03028d561c196e3"], "node": "3d00ec09778a52d764f67e6d29ddca87270e5c7e", "parents": ["3884962d6354755dd09d8d2515c115cccdea7a72"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794943916, "git_changesets": ["6c28c68671bc54a97