072337: Wait until DataChannel is shut down before shutting down the transport. r=ng\n\nAlso some simplification; it looks like there is no situation where we\nreally wanted/needed to reset all streams during teardown, so I've\nremoved that.\n\nMake DataChannelConnection::SendPacket STS-only; the usrsctp\nimplementation called this from a different thread, but that's gone now.\n\nLastly, for the virtual functions in DataChannelConnection, document\nwhat thread they are called on.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342213\n", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/jsapi/PeerConnectionImpl.cpp", "netwerk/sctp/datachannel/DataChannel.cpp", "netwerk/sctp/datachannel/DataChannel.h", "netwerk/sctp/datachannel/DataChannelDcSctp.cpp", "netwerk/sctp/datachannel/DataChannelDcSctp.h"], "git_node": "2494e9b6cc28af9eaa661a22bad001f6a8897af4", "git_parents": ["ea71900566b5d3e6fe6d7fe8b5746fa0f592d4d1"], "node": "991def856dd30244f0fa31436245b5f7ebb8abec", "parents": ["fdc84f9c55a298083c8caf0e906ed4f1ae7afdc6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2090117 - Only let first-line re-parenting change first-line-allowed properties. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,layout-reviewers,jwatt\" for causing multiple failures.\n\nThis reverts commit 6009e601af92ea57df6024b6e508fc93a11af7e9.\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/properties/cascade.rs", "servo/components/style/properties/properties.mako.rs"], "git_node": "3d4b3b32dba0b8a97500d7316fb8a1e09ce09ed7", "git_parents": ["2494e9b6cc28af9eaa661a22bad001f6a8897af4"], "node": "035f106649a499f47f652d99560b2bc24d87d5dc", "parents": ["991def856dd30244f0fa31436245b5f7ebb8abec"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rebecca King \u003crking@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2094188 - Update set to default promo string to handle plurals - r=flod,fluent-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343582\n", "files": ["browser/locales/en-US/browser/ipProtection.ftl"], "git_node": "67dbfe8946644e2d35a1ad727318fe083d4fed0b", "git_parents": ["3d4b3b32dba0b8a97500d7316fb8a1e09ce09ed7"], "node": "e7ee84c74c9e38b1eb54706c71884d5ab92a80cf", "parents": ["035f106649a499f47f652d99560b2bc24d87d5dc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "John M. Schanck \u003cjschanck@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2092696 - display ML-DSA SPKIs in the certificate viewer. r=keeler\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342783\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/certviewer/content/certDecoder.mjs", "toolkit/components/certviewer/content/certviewer.mjs", "toolkit/components/certviewer/tests/browser/browser.toml", "toolkit/components/certviewer/tests/browser/browser_checkMLDSA.js", "toolkit/components/certviewer/tests/browser/mldsa44.pem", "toolkit/components/certviewer/tests/browser/mldsa44.pem.certspec"], "git_node": "cd00b41dfb122470dac189758965d708a80eb731", "git_parents": ["67dbfe8946644e2d35a1ad727318fe083d4fed0b"], "node": "77335b999343aae13f8b035c5c8c67c242fa7b42", "parents": ["e7ee84c74c9e38b1eb54706c71884d5ab92a80cf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "John M. Schanck \u003cjschanck@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2092723 - enable ML-DSA in TLS in Nightly. r=keeler\n\nThe ML-DSA signature schemes are also advertised first to reflect\nour preference for post-quantum algorithms.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342795\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "security/manager/ssl/EnabledSignatureSchemes.h"], "git_node": "74e95614ebd83a28a1f871384f4ea74e970ec23c", "git_parents": ["cd00b41dfb122470dac189758965d708a80eb731"], "node": "fd543f9d427460d567fdd14aad39482dae437c77", "parents": ["77335b999343aae13f8b035c5c8c67c242fa7b42"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andreas Farre \u003cfarre@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089454 - Filter opaque beacon responses like ping re