ntized-matmul fallback still leave incorrect Intel\nMetal results. Kernels assume 32-lane SIMD groups but compile at 8 or 16.\nKeep Metal on Apple Silicon, including Rosetta, and add Intel CI coverage.\n\nOnly about 30% of Firefox users on macOS still use x86_64.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343577\n", "files": ["taskcluster/test_configs/test-sets.yml", "toolkit/components/ml/backends/llama/LlamaRuntimeLinker.cpp"], "git_node": "1f83e2106231ba2da104060530898a3859396489", "git_parents": ["4dbebf0f857661c3003505afefe3d4af8e280597"], "node": "b1499dc141ef18acf1d8f18a7c379b8603618a65", "parents": ["045b3dc0d659ab836c2f8613f91ef43d5b5f25f3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Krist Baliev \u003ckbaliev@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083511 - Remove the Nova pref check from icon-capture-address-fields.svg. r=mtigley,desktop-theme-reviewers,tgiles\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342334\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/formautofill/icon-capture-address-fields.svg"], "git_node": "c25c92398dcbbc71dadecd3279f9e6e515716e89", "git_parents": ["1f83e2106231ba2da104060530898a3859396489"], "node": "1f00c472f1ae2ff0fed50b32ba3404d8184bd9ac", "parents": ["b1499dc141ef18acf1d8f18a7c379b8603618a65"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Micah Killoran \u003cmtigley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2092928 - Don't offer the security code toggle in card doorhangers while saving security codes is off. r=credential-management-reviewers,dimi\n\nThe security code is left out of the submitted card while saving is off, so\nturning the toggle on from the doorhanger couldn't save it. Turning saving\nback on is left to Settings.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342901\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/formautofill/test/browser/creditCard/browser_creditCard_doorhanger_cvv.js", "toolkit/components/formautofill/default/FormAutofillPrompter.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "6