e certificate details sub-page header now has a back button and shows only the\nhost, like the trackers sub-pages, and the sub-page shows who verified the\ncertificate. The EU trust mark is 85dp high as in the design, while staying at least\n64 pixels wide as the regulation requires. The \"Secure connection\" link may take up\nto two thirds of the header row, so it is no longer cut off at the default font\nsize, and the space under the drag handle is 16dp on QWAC sites.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D343957\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/trustpanel/TrustPanelFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/trustpanel/ui/CertificateDetailsPanel.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/trustpanel/ui/ProtectionPanelHeader.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/trustpanel/ui/CertificateDetailsPanelTest.kt"], "git_node": "998543eee23aac7243136dd5955d6e32ad401481", "git_parents": ["4f7e1198b07ead0bee2c40925b0890ef6fde25ec"], "node": "987caebd53553a6d75f1fccac7fa1b9ea7017aac", "parents": ["8fdc3d906dc4da9478f546969d2b6138d00b3048"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Niklas Baumgardner \u003cnbaumgardner@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089676 - Import multiple visits per url from Safari history. r=jhirsch,migration-reviewers,mconley\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340517\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/migration/ChromeProfileMigrator.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/MigrationUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/SafariProfileMigrator.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/test_Safari_history.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/test_Safari_history_strange_entries.js"], "git_node": "35a9eb08b2c0db02107f975dde35fa559f35de02", "git_parents": ["998543eee23aac7243136dd5955d6e32ad