nsitively and only after the colon in the process name, so `isolatedTab` and `zygoteTab` exits count as content and the package id cannot affect any process type.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338252\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/perf/ApplicationExitInfoMetrics.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/perf/ApplicationExitInfoMetricsTest.kt"], "git_node": "e03375079a6d6489f73b0c58589e18d1f9bb509a", "git_parents": ["ac40cfa1eb14345cce30d0bc118f378bcdb8a535"], "node": "651f547a6f7ae526f1325f25444515436096c581", "parents": ["eb8de0619b88df80fd7dc439b4c060f84ee9e028"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Christopher DiPersio \u003ccdipersio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085180 - Implement basics of DigestManager r=cmurray,mlucks\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340150\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/browser-static/browser_all_files_referenced.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/memories/digests/DigestManager.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/memories/digests/DigestStore.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/memories/digests/moz.build", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_DigestManager.js"], "git_node": "ded5c052de64178f9e365067598de8483908a41a", "git_parents": ["e03375079a6d6489f73b0c58589e18d1f9bb509a"], "node": "36f9f129685dc316ed28214be2c338ad517fa39a", "parents": ["651f547a6f7ae526f1325f25444515436096c581"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2089076, Bug 2052469 - Report the IP Protection auth provider in use to Android apps. r=geckoview-reviewers,android-reviewers,sfamisa,owlish\" for causing xpcshell failures at /test_IPPGpiAuthProvider.js\n\nThis reverts commit 8103c85e2ebcb600f4fc784f42f11203e49bd053.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2052469 - Pass the signed-out IP Protection auth provider to GeckoView on init. r=geckoview-reviewers,android-reviewers,apopov,sfamisa,owlish\"\n\nThis reverts commit 0956b5e46317bd50641bbb47910e7b46df398706.\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/GeckoEngine.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/ipprotection/GeckoIPProtectionDelegate.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/ipprotection/GeckoIPProtectionHandler.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/ipprotection/GeckoIPProtectionDelegateTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/concept/engine/src/main/java/mozilla/components/concept/engine/Settings.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/concept/engine/src/main/java/mozilla/components/concept/engine/ipprotection/IPProtectionDelegate.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/concept/engine/src/main/java/mozilla/components/concept/engine/ipprotection/IPProtectionHandler.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/IPProtectionFeature.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/store/Actions.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/store/middleware/IPProtectionEngineMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/store/middleware/IPProtectionLocationMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/store/reducer/ServiceReducer.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/store/state/State.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/FakeIPProtectionHandler.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/IPProtectionFeatureTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/store/reducer/IPProtectionReducerTest.kt", "mobile/android/app/geckoview-prefs.js", "mobile/android/fenix/app/nimbus.fml.yaml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/ipprotection/IPProtection.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/utils/Settings.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/static_strings.xml", "mobile/android/geckoview/api.txt", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/IPProtectionControllerTest.kt", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/GeckoRuntimeSettings.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/IPProtectionController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/doc-files/CHANGELOG.md", "mobile/shared/components/geckoview/GeckoViewStartup.sys.mjs", "mobile/shared/modules/geckoview/GeckoViewIPProtection.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/docs/Components.md", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/fxa/IPPAndroidSignInWatcher.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/gpi/IPPGpiAuthProvider.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/tests/xpcshell/test_IPPGpiAuthProvider.js"], "git_node": "c36ab7d368c390aaa1a74c6234fb2b784d7b0a7a", "git_parents": ["ded5c052de64178f9e365067598de8483908a41a"], "node": "13bc8f4c26fd5549bdc901dac16815bb8429975e", "parents": ["36f9f129685